OL,4,CHope docks' silt crisis could soon be  
OL,5,Cover                                   
OL,6,GIt is hoped a #4m dredging operation   
OL,7,Gwill clear most of the silt plaguing   
OL,8,Ghistoric docks in time for the boating 
OL,9,Gseason "early in 2027", the Canal and  
OL,10,GRiver Trust (CRT) says.                
OL,12,FThe CRT, which manages the Gloucester  
OL,13,Fand Sharpness Canal, began dredging    
OL,14,FGloucester Docks last month after the  
OL,15,Fsilt levels became so high that boats  
OL,16,Fwere trapped and the docks had to      
OL,17,Fclose.                                 
OL,19,FBen Cottam, regional director for CRT, 
OL,20,Fsaid silt was entrained further down   
OL,21,Fthe canal than originally anticipated, 
OL,22,Fwhich had been "a challenge".     G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
