OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CNew drones could tackle crime 'within  
OL,5,C30 seconds'                            
OL,6,GNew drones featuring loud speakers and 
OL,7,Gspotlights could be introduced in a    
OL,8,Gtown centre to clamp down on crime.    
OL,10,FIt is hoped the first trial will begin 
OL,11,Fin March 2027, when a drone will be    
OL,12,Fplaced on top of Swindon's fire        
OL,13,Fstation that can be deployed to        
OL,14,Fincidents as they unfold.              
OL,16,FPhilip Wilkinson OBE, Police and Crime 
OL,17,FCommissioner (PCC) for Wiltshire, said 
OL,18,Fthe drone could "cover anywhere" in    
OL,19,Fthe town centre.                       
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
