OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CMurder accused 'didn't mean to push    
OL,5,Cman in marina'                         
OL,6,GA man accused of murder said he did    
OL,7,Gnot mean to push the victim into a     
OL,8,Gmarina, a court has heard.             
OL,10,FLayton Randle, 19, of Oakfield Terrace 
OL,11,FRoad, Plymouth, denies the murder of   
OL,12,F24-year-old Drew Perham at King Point  
OL,13,FMarina in the early hours of 24        
OL,14,FJanuary.                               
OL,16,FAsked how he felt about causing        
OL,17,FPerham's death, Randle told Plymouth   
OL,18,FCrown Court on Wednesday, it was "very 
OL,19,Fupsetting" and "hard". He later added  
OL,20,Fhe "didn't mean for him to fall over   
OL,21,Fthe edge" of the marina into the water.
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
